              "name": "prompts",
              "value": "[\"A minimalist black and white hand-drawn Stickman illustration, a simple Stickman character wearing a small backpack standing in front of his small house, holding a map and preparing for an adventure, sunny morning, thick black outlines, subtle gray shading, cinematic composition, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"A minimalist black and white hand-drawn Stickman illustration, the same Stickman character wearing the same small backpack walking through a dense forest while holding a compass, tall trees surrounding him, adventurous atmosphere, thick black outlines, subtle gray shading, cinematic composition, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"A minimalist black and white hand-drawn Stickman illustration, the same Stickman character wearing the same small backpack discovering an old abandoned wooden cabin deep in the forest, standing in front of the mysterious cabin and looking surprised, adventurous mystery atmosphere, thick black outlines, subtle gray shading, cinematic composition, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"A minimalist black and white hand-drawn Stickman illustration, the same Stickman character wearing the same small backpack meeting a small friendly fox in a forest clearing, the Stickman crouching and looking at the fox with curiosity, warm emotional moment, thick black outlines, subtle gray shading, cinematic composition, 16:9 aspect ratio.\", \"A minimalist black and white hand-drawn Stickman illustration, the same Stickman character wearing the same small backpack returning home at sunset after his adventure, standing in front of his small house and looking at the sunset, peaceful ending, thick black outlines, subtle gray shading, cinematic composition, 16:9 aspect ratio.\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "dd8a83ea-aef3-4a78-afba-76782dcc93b9",
              "name": "narrations",
              "value": "[\"Le matin venu, notre aventurier prépare son sac et s'apprête à partir à l'aventure.\", \"Il s'enfonce dans la forêt, boussole en main, guidé par sa curiosité.\", \"Au détour d'un sentier, il découvre une vieille cabane abandonnée, mystérieuse et silencieuse.\", \"Dans une clairière, un petit renard curieux vient à sa rencontre.\", \"Le soleil se couche alors qu'il rentre chez lui, le cœur rempli de souvenirs.\"]",
              "type": "array"
            }
